# label: alg:ch76-differential
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch76.tex:154
# caption: Check a foreign-call path against a compiler-generated native oracle.

REQUIRE trusted declaration, native function, ABI descriptors, boundary-value cases
ENSURE compared paths agree on status and defined output fields
FORALL input cases DO
  initialize independent native and FFI output storage with sentinels
  call the declared function directly
  call the same function through libffi with independently built slots
  compare statuses and every semantically defined result field
  verify unchanged outputs where the failure contract requires them
END FOR
compare descriptor layout with native size, alignment, and offsets

